sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Flutter as Reflex Flutter App
    participant Server as Serverpod Server
    participant Handler as DiagnosticEventHandler
    participant Sentry as Sentry Cloud

    User->>Flutter: Triggers action / encounters unexpected error
    alt Server Exception
        Server->>Server: Unhandled Exception in Serverpod execution
        Server->>Handler: DiagnosticEvent.submit(ExceptionEvent)
        Handler->>Handler: Filter out DomainException (expected 4xx business flows)
        Handler->>Handler: Scrub credentials & student answer text
        Handler->>Sentry: Capture Exception with Serverpod StackTrace
    else Flutter Exception
        Flutter->>Flutter: FlutterError / uncaught Dart error
        Flutter->>Flutter: beforeSend callback scrubs student inputs & passwords
        Flutter->>Sentry: SentryFlutter.captureException()
    end
    note over Sentry: Error visible in Sentry Dashboard with breadcrumbs
